</p>


## Barriers in Internet Access

#### Before you move on...

* #### Learn more about challenges in Internet access by exploring <a href='https://levelbuilder-studio.code.org/courses/artificial-intelligence-foundations-v2-2025/units/4/lessons/7/levels/1' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' style='text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;'>data from the Pew Research Center</a>. Click continue as you read through the levels learn about Internet use over time, home broadband use by income, Internet use by age, and more. <br> This content is covered in Lesson 7: The Internet's Hidden Barriers.

* #### Learn more communities affected by Internet access by exploring the <a href='https://docs.google.com/document/d/1yn_Z-uroLVk7Lo5-wp9BjonpRRjnnliIUmGpoRv_2Ls/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.5ychaexmv4p8' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' style='text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;'>Persona Fact Sheets</a> from Day 1 of the Internet Access Advocacy Campaign Project. <br> You can also interact with each of these personas using an <a href='https://levelbuilder-studio.code.org/courses/artificial-intelligence-foundations-v2-2025/units/4/lessons/7/levels/6' target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' style='text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;'>AI Chatbot</a> from Lesson 7: The Internet's Hidden Barriers.

<br>

